Subject: [PATCH 49/76] v2 fail-closed: vLLM workers get
 PR_SET_PDEATHSIG(SIGKILL) against their EngineCore parent (with getppid race
 check), so workers cannot outlive a killed EngineCore when the API process
 manager SIGKILLs it before executor worker teardown (V.3 campaign-2
 exc_async_output orphan, 2/4 repro); parent-death subprocess tests (fork
 busy-spin, spawn sleep, graceful SIGTERM) (Sol draft, Fable applied/tested)

Tests: new executor parent-death tests 3/3 (2 red on d8ceefc65a); tests/v1/ple_offload 128/128.
